    "updated_at": "2016-04-09T09:37:03Z",
    "body": "This is another valid argument that using `list-item` and `list-style-*` on `<summary>` is probably a wrong decision.\n\nWe probably want `<ol>`, `<ul>`, `<menu>` themselves to use `list-style` rather than `list-style-type` so that they have their `list-style-position` specified, but that could be undesired sometimes as well.\n",
