    "updated_at": "2016-04-20T21:56:44Z",
    "body": "Ping @tabatkins @fantasai. Mozilla is actively trying to ship a `<details>` implementation based on this design, and these sorts of problems are highlighting that maybe the list item model is not great.\n\nShould we continue with the list item model, and implement another fix like @aethanyc mentions in his OP? Or does the CSSWG want to consider a different way of handling the disclosure marker?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
