    "body": "FWIW, I fixed the issue in Firefox by using\n\n``` css\ndetails > summary:first-of-type > *|* {\n    list-style-position: initial;\n}\n```\n\nin [html.css](https://dxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/4feb4dd910a5a2d3061dbdd376a80975206819c6/layout/style/res/html.css#787-790)\n",
