    "created_at": "2016-04-21T18:09:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-21T18:10:23Z",
    "body": "This is pretty easy to fix if instead of having list-style-position apply to `display: list-item`, we make it apply only to the marker box. It will continue to inherit through as it does currently, but `<summary>` can then set it on its `::marker` directly, which will not inherit through to any descendants.\n\n`summary::marker { list-style-position: inside }`\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
