    "created_at": "2019-08-17T02:01:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-17T02:01:49Z",
    "body": "I'll note that currently the [HTML spec forbids lists inside SUMMARY](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#the-summary-element). Is this still an issue we're concerned about?\r\n\r\nIf it is, we should fix it as proposed in the [previous comment](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#the-li-element), and I would welcome an issue against the css-lists-3 spec to that effect. If it's not, then let's close this issue since nothing needs to be fixed.",
