    "updated_at": "2019-08-19T12:52:42Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure, it's indeed always been forbidden, not sure why we didn't discuss that before. @aethanyc thoughts on that?\r\n\r\nI'm somewhat hesitant to close this though without having a number of tests and agreement from implementers to match those tests (assuming they are different from the specification today, as seems to be the case).",
