    "body": "> I'll note that currently the [HTML spec forbids lists inside SUMMARY](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#the-summary-element). Is this still an issue we're concerned about?\r\n\r\nYes. As far as I can tell, it's valid to use `<summary><h1 style=\"display: list-item;\">h1</h1></summary>`, and then `<h1>` inherits from `summary` whatever default `list-style` specified in the user-agent stylesheet.",
