    "body": "@fantasai Right. `<h1 style=\"display: list-item;\">` in `<summary>` is a rare case. Most of the usages of `<summary>` are probably text only. I'm now totally OK with the current status.\r\n\r\nAs the spec has forbidden `<li>` in `<summary>`, authors should use it at their own discretion even if the browsers still render it in some way. ",
